BoxOffice SQL Data Analysis - Dataset Information

This project uses four raw CSV files:

1. boxoffice.csv
2. director.csv
3. genre.csv
4. language.csv


BOXOFFICE DATASET

FilmID
Unique identifier for each film.

Title
The title of the film.

Release Date
The date on which the film was released.

Lead Actor/Actress
The primary actor or actress starring in the film.

Industry
The film industry to which the film belongs, such as Bollywood or Tollywood.

Budget in Crores
The production budget of the film in crores.

First Day Collection Worldwide in Crores
The worldwide box office collection on the first day of release.

Worldwide Collection in Crores
Total worldwide box office collection in crores.

Overseas Collection in Crores
Total box office collection from overseas markets in crores.

India Gross Collection in Crores
Total box office collection within India in crores.

Verdict
Overall performance assessment of the film, such as Hit, Flop or Blockbuster.

IMDb Rating
IMDb rating of the film.

Runtime (mins)
Total runtime of the film in minutes.

OTT Platform
OTT platform where the film is available for streaming.

DirectorID
Unique ID of the director.

LanguageID
Unique ID of the language.

GenreID
Unique ID of the genre.

GENRE DATASET

Genre
The genre of the film, such as Action, Drama or Comedy.

GenreID
Unique ID of the genre.


LANGUAGE DATASET

Language
The language in which the film was produced.

LanguageID
Unique ID of the language.

DIRECTOR DATASET

Director
The director of the film.

DirectorID
Unique ID of the director.
